{
  "title": "DateFormatter reallocated on every call in multiple views",
  "description": "`Ramekin/RecipeDetailViewVersioning.swift:219-224` \
(`formatDate`), `Ramekin/MealPlanView.swift:141-143` (week header), \
`MealPlanView.swift:186-188` (day header), and `MealPlanView.swift:274-278` \
(localDateString) all construct a fresh `DateFormatter` per call. \
Version-history rows and the meal planner render dozens of dates per frame. \
Cache static formatters like `RecipeListFilterSupport` already does. For \
comparison, instrumenting a meal-plan week (7 days × 4 meal slots + header) \
easily creates >10 DateFormatters per render pass.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "task",
  "labels": [
    "ios",
    "performance",
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-04-17T12:00:00-07:00",
}
